      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-72252\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">2.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/849#5222\">Determining the Equation of a Tall Ellipse</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"72252\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-72252\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>What is the equation of the ellipse given above?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Mon, Oct 12th @ 9:11 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:25</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
